  "notes": "Open-source-Zotero-like web client ('altero') with Material 3 tonal palette (teal #006a6a primary, mint #aedcdb selected-state fill). Toolbars are pill-shaped light-grey icon groups; detail panel is a rounded light-grey card. Table has no vertical rules, only row dividers; selected row has a left teal accent bar and grey fill. Tag chips are outlined pills with optional colour dot, count pill and rename pencil, wrapping in the sidebar. Item-type line icons per row (document, book, web page, note). Detail fields include a creator row with drag handle, role dropdown, last/first inputs, −/+/… controls; DOI/URL have external-link buttons; date shows 'y m' parse hint."
